    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemists are employed by <strong>The Company</strong>. After decades of work and millions spent, they have now been deemed redundant. As per policy, all R&amp;D materials are considered company property and must be surrendered. Most complied, except for <strong>Four Alchemists</strong> who went dark, likely refusing to cooperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where <strong>The Inspector</strong> comes in. As a corporate assassin, you are tasked with retrieving stolen property by any means necessary. The alchemists reside in their respective estates, fight through hordes of enemies and complete the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0- Wield a variety of weapons, each with unique variants.<br><strong>Buffs</strong>\u00a0- Enhance your abilities with powerful passive upgrades. Adapt and stack buffs to create devastating synergies.<br><strong>Throwing Equipment</strong>\u00a0- Use bombs, knives, and more to gain the upper hand.<br><strong>Estates</strong>\u00a0- Battle through four distinct areas, each with its own enemies and hazards.<br><strong>The Four Alchemists</strong>\u00a0- Face off against powerful bosses, each with unique abilities and deadly attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stay up to date with the game by following us on social media.</i></strong></p>",
